  "details": "Hello, when I would make an avatar, I always wanted to pop up a sign that says \"T-Pose for dominance\" when I would calibrate. I've looked in the SDK in the past and present beta and can't determine a way to know if a player is calibrating or not. Add a variable for \"isCalibrating\" that we can read within our FX?\nThis can open up some opportunities with not just showing signs, but possibly smooth transitions in between t-pose and your live IK or add a cheesy clip in between.",
